{"id":"3649d545bdff9369","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-size-class.md","title":"有界扇入电路规模类SIZE","display":"df-size-class — 有界扇入电路规模类SIZE","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-size-class","aliases":["28-df-size-class"],"display":"df-size-class — 有界扇入电路规模类SIZE","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §6.1 and Theorem 6.22 notation","source_printed_pages":"107–108,116","source_pdf_pages":"133–134,142","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-size-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-size-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-size-class — 有界扇入电路规模类SIZE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §6.1 and Theorem 6.22 notation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107–108,116"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"133–134,142"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SIZE}(s)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left[\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le cs(n)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SIZE}(s)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left[\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le cs(n)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本项明确采用允许常数因子的SIZE(O(s))约定，并限定有界扇入；原书部分精确规模陈述写SIZE(s)，两者不得直接替换其中的数值常数。不限定一致性或可计算性，故此处是语言集合，不一定包含于可判定语言。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§6.1 and Theorem 6.22 notation；印刷 pp.107–108,116 / PDF pp.133–134,142。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]；$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCircFam},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SIZE}(s)\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*: \\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left[\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le cs(n)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^n\\;(\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle\\leftrightarrow x\\in L)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1719,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-294","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-size-class]]、[[28-df-time-advice-class]]、[[28-thm-p-poly-advice]]、[[28-thm-p-uniform-characterization]]、[[28-thm-nonuniform-hierarchy]]、[[28-df-circuit-eval]]。"},{"id":"1f2f0d7b9495bf06","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SIZE}$ 是 [[28-df-size-class]] 的有界扇入、允许常数因子的规模类。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","14f69cc09dc02600"]}